OL,3,GNEWSASerco employee charged over
OL,4,Asharing asylum seeker addresses
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn employee of a company that provides
OL,7,Faccommodation for asylum seekers has
OL,8,Fbeen charged with misconduct in public
OL,9,Foffice over sharing the properties'
OL,10,Faddresses.
OL,12,FHouses in St John's Way, Bracken Road,
OL,13,FClover Way, Elm Road and Chester Way in
OL,14,FThetford, Norfolk, were targeted by
OL,15,Fcrowds over three nights earlier this
OL,16,Fmonth.
OL,18,FJames Jobson, 62, from Highlow Road,
OL,19,FCostessey, near Norwich, works at Serco
OL,20,Fand appeared at Ipswich Magistrates'
OL,21,FCourt on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,378,370,200,160,0,100
